  _description: '**Effect:** The character performs a powerful, focused strike. If
    you accumulated stacks from Critical Momentum, those bonuses improve the character''s
    chance of landing a critical hit and the resulting critical damage.


    **Explanation:**
    The Character converts the critical potential they had built up into a powerful
    attack. This gives players a reason to balance weaker, reliable attacks against
    a more expensive strike with greater damage potential.'
